# =============================================================================
# KiThumbs worker — environment variables
# =============================================================================
# At the current repository revision (post YouTube-sync rollback), the worker
# directory contains NO runnable application code — only this placeholder and
# `.gitignore`. There is nothing to start and no process that reads these vars.
#
# This file is kept so future worker work has a clear contract. Do not expect
# `bun run` / Docker worker services to exist until worker source is restored.
#
# See docs/WORKER.md for the current state and historical context.
# =============================================================================

# NODE_ENV=development

# Future (not used by this revision):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/DATABASE
# REDIS_URL=redis://:PASSWORD@HOST:6379
# FRONTEND_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
# WORKER_SHARED_TOKEN=replace-with-long-random-secret
